# Agent Boundaries

Agents MUST NOT modify the following without an explicit user 
request in the same conversation:
- package.json \uthor\, \license\, \epository\, or \unding\ 
  fields
- .gitignore entries
- Git branch structure (creating/deleting branches)
- Git remote configuration
- Files outside the specific package named in the task
- Docs files that were not mentioned in the task

If an agent believes such a change is necessary, it MUST ask 
first and wait for approval. Silent scope expansion is a 
policy violation.
